# Orchestra AI — Multi-Agent Software Development System

A local-first, hierarchical multi-agent AI system where specialized agents collaboratively plan, build, review, and deliver software projects.

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    UI[React Dashboard] -->|REST API| API[FastAPI Backend]
    API --> ORCH[Orchestrator]
    ORCH --> TB[Task Board]
    ORCH --> AR[Agent Registry]
    ORCH --> TL[Tool Layer]
    ORCH --> GIT[Git Manager]
    ORCH --> MEM[Memory System]
    ORCH --> LLM[LLM Gateway]
    ORCH --> ACE[ACE Learning]
    AR --> PM[PM Agent]
    AR --> UX[UX Agent]
    AR --> FE[Frontend Agent]
    AR --> BE[Backend Agent]
    AR --> FS[FullStack Agent]
    AR --> RE[Research Agent]
    AR --> DB[DB Engineer Agent]
    MEM --> FAISS[FAISS Vector Store]
    MEM --> SQLite[SQLite DB]
    LLM --> LOCAL[Local Models]
    LLM --> REMOTE[Remote APIs]
```

