## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Project Foundation

#### [NEW] Folder structure and scaffolding
Create the complete directory tree and all `__init__.py` files.

#### [NEW] [requirements.txt](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/requirements.txt)
Dependencies: `fastapi`, `uvicorn`, `sqlalchemy`, `pydantic`, `faiss-cpu`, `sentence-transformers`, `gitpython`, `httpx`, `python-dotenv`

#### [NEW] [config.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/config.py)
Application settings via Pydantic `BaseSettings` — database path, LLM defaults, Git config, sandbox settings.

---

### Phase 2: Data Models & Database

#### [NEW] [database.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/database.py)
SQLAlchemy engine + session factory targeting `data/orchestra.db`.

#### [NEW] ORM Models — `models/*.py`

| Model | Key Fields |
|-------|-----------|
| **Task** | id, title, description, acceptance_criteria, status (backlog/in_progress/review/done), dependencies, owner_agent_id, reviewer_agent_ids, risk_level, effort_estimate, created_at, updated_at |
| **Agent** | id, name, role, model_profile, status (idle/busy/paused), capabilities |
| **Artifact** | id, task_id, agent_id, type (code/doc/design), content, file_path, created_at |
| **RunLog** | id, task_id, agent_id, action, input_data, output_data, status, timestamp, duration_ms |
| **PullRequest** | id, task_id, branch_name, title, what, why, how, test_plan, status, created_at |

---

### Phase 3: Agent Framework

#### [NEW] [base.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/agents/base.py)
Abstract `BaseAgent` class:
- `execute(task_input: TaskInput) -> AgentOutput` — structured I/O
- `AgentOutput` contains: reasoning_summary, solution_artifact, attachments, validation_checklist
- Agents NEVER modify codebase directly — all changes returned as artifacts

#### [NEW] Specialized agents — `agents/pm.py`, `agents/ux_designer.py`, etc.
Each agent inherits `BaseAgent`, has a system prompt loaded from `prompts/`, and implements domain-specific execution logic. The agent calls the LLM Gateway with its model profile.

#### [NEW] [registry.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/agents/registry.py)
Agent registry: register, list, get by role/id.

---

### Phase 4: Orchestrator

#### [NEW] [core.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/orchestrator/core.py)
Central Orchestrator:
- Receives user requests → delegates to PM for task breakdown
- Routes tasks to appropriate agents based on role/capability
- Mediates ALL tool access (file, git, terminal)
- Manages the full pipeline lifecycle

#### [NEW] [review.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/orchestrator/review.py)
Review cycle:
- Every completed task goes to assigned reviewer agent
- Reviewer returns structured feedback (approve/revise + comments)
- Orchestrator decides: Approve → Git commit, Revise → send back to owner

#### [NEW] [workflow.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/orchestrator/workflow.py)
Full pipeline: request → plan → assign → execute → review → approve → git → done

---

### Phase 5: Task Management

#### [NEW] API routes — `api/tasks.py`
CRUD for tasks + state transitions + board queries. Endpoints:
- `POST /api/tasks` — create task
- `GET /api/tasks` — list (filterable by status)
- `PATCH /api/tasks/{id}` — update/transition
- `GET /api/tasks/board` — Kanban grouped view

---

### Phase 6: LLM Gateway

#### [NEW] [gateway.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/llm/gateway.py)
Unified `LLMGateway.generate(prompt, model_profile) -> LLMResponse`. Routes through model registry → provider adapter.

#### [NEW] [registry.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/llm/registry.py)
Model Registry: register models with metadata (provider, latency, cost, privacy level).

#### [NEW] Provider adapters — `llm/providers/local.py`, `llm/providers/remote.py`
- **Local**: Calls llama.cpp server or HuggingFace Transformers
- **Remote**: OpenAI / Claude API calls via httpx

#### [NEW] [router.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/llm/router.py)
Routes requests based on agent model profile: primary → fallback chain, respecting budget/latency/privacy constraints.

---

### Phase 7: Memory System

#### [NEW] [short_term.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/memory/short_term.py)
In-memory dict store per task context — requirements, intermediate results, conversation history.

#### [NEW] [long_term.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/memory/long_term.py)
FAISS vector store using `sentence-transformers` for embedding. Stores design decisions, past outputs, code artifacts. Persisted to `data/vector_store/`.

---

### Phase 8: Git + PR Integration

#### [NEW] [operations.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/git_manager/operations.py)
GitPython wrapper: init repo, create branch, commit files, list branches.

#### [NEW] [pr_manager.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/git_manager/pr_manager.py)
Create PR record in DB with: what, why, how, test_plan. Validate before marking task Done.

---

### Phase 9: Tooling Layer

#### [NEW] [executor.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/tools/executor.py)
All tool execution goes through the Orchestrator → ToolExecutor. Validates permissions, executes, and logs every action to RunLog.

#### [NEW] Tool implementations — `tools/file_system.py`, `tools/git_ops.py`, `tools/terminal.py`
- **FileSystem**: Read/write/list with per-agent path restrictions
- **GitOps**: Wrapper around git_manager (commit, branch, etc.)
- **Terminal**: Subprocess execution in sandboxed environment

---

### Phase 10: ACE Learning System

#### [NEW] [engine.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/ace/engine.py)
Context Learning Engine (Mode A — always on):
- Ingests approved task outputs, reviews, test results
- Generates playbooks and decision records
- All learning is versioned and rollback-supported

#### [NEW] [playbooks.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/ace/playbooks.py), [decisions.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/ace/decisions.py), [versioning.py](file:///Users/jiviteshbansal/Desktop/orchestra%20AI%20Made/backend/ace/versioning.py)
Supporting modules for playbook generation, decision tracking, and version management.

---

### Phase 11: Dashboard UI (React + TypeScript)

#### [NEW] React app via Vite
Key components:
- **TaskBoard.tsx**: Kanban board with drag-drop columns (Backlog, In Progress, Review, Done)
- **AgentFeed.tsx**: Real-time agent activity log
- **ArtifactViewer.tsx**: View code/docs/designs produced by agents
- **Controls.tsx**: Approve PR, Pause Agent, Reassign Task buttons

Premium design with dark theme, glassmorphism, micro-animations, Inter font.

